gwi:dataset-estx50 a dcat:Dataset ;
    dcterms:description "Snapshot of the 50 EURO STOXX 50 constituents with country, ICB subsector and FY2024 revenue. Remark on the numbers: revenue figures are approximate, in each company's reporting currency (recorded, not converted; do not sum across currencies), and not comparable across sectors. ICB subsector assignments are provisional, derived from the taxonomy labels, and must be verified against FTSE Russell's classification."@en ;
    dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> ;
    dcterms:title "EURO STOXX 50 constituents, FY2024"@en ;
    dcat:distribution gwi:distribution-csv2,
        gwi:distribution-icb-assignments .

